# F122 ARM C -- the ADJACENT TRIPLE: arm B plus the third camera line, issued
# while the 3 s travel is STILL IN FLIGHT. Differs from armB.sts by exactly
# one added line, and from internal/fly_to_selected.sts by exactly one thing:
# the shipped file selects the altitude through `struct if body_selected`,
# which with a body selected takes the 100000 branch written literally here.
body action preload name selected
timerate rate 1
flag track_object on
audio filename lift-off.wav action play
wait duration 1
moveto altitude 20000000 duration 3
wait duration 3
camera action transition_to target point name Space
camera action move_to target body body_name selected duration 3 altitude 100000
camera action transition_to target body name selected
